  "type": "Interface",
  "fields": {
    "name": "ShardKey<...> hierarchical virtual-compound-key library family",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "text",
    "contract": "ShardKey<...> provides one value-key family with generic arities 1, 2, 3, and 4. Each value combines one shard identifier with one record identity and zero to three ordered subordinate identities. Consumers can construct a value from those constituents; serialize it as binary, UTF-8, or an external key; reconstruct it from binary/UTF-8 or an external key; compare it for complete constituent identity; derive a hash code; obtain its empty value; collect distinct shard identifiers; exclude its own shard identifier from a collection; and merge keyed records by this complete identity."
  },
